menu "esp-vim board layer"

    config ESP_VIM_BOARD_TAB5
        bool "M5Stack Tab5"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
        default n
        help
            The Tab5's own hardware, through Espressif's board support
            package (m5stack_tab5_noglib): the internal I2C bus (GPIO31/32)
            and its two PI4IOE5V6408 IO expanders, which switch the ESP32-C6's
            power, the USB-A port's 5 V, the LCD, touch and speaker; and the
            MIPI-DSI panel, whichever of the three fitted revisions it is
            (ILI9881C + GT911, ST7123, ST7121).

endmenu
